      "pages": [
        {
          "url": "http://www.littleheadskayakrentals.com/",
          "text": "Home\nAbout our Location\nLittleheads Kayak Rentals\nTo book a tour or rental\nMore\nPictures\nOur theme\nDiscounts and Specials\nLittleheads Kayak Rentals\nLittleheads Kayak RentalsLittleheads Kayak RentalsLittleheads Kayak Rentals\nHome\nAbout our Location\nTo book a tour or rental\nPictures\nOur theme\nDiscounts and Specials\nKayaking\nKayaking Kayaking Kayaking\nDolphin Sightings Daily\n\nOur Satwater bay has a nursery pod of dolphins consisting of baby dolphins, mama dolphins, and god mother dolphins. Dolphins are seen every day! This video was taken from our kayak launch area. In this video you can see baby calves nursing on a mother dolphin. Come experience all the life our saltwater estuary has to offer!\n\nOUR SERVICES\nFun for the Whole Family Rentals\nFun for the Whole Family Rentals\nFun for the Whole Family Rentals\n\nKayaking is fun for everyone! Explore our area on your own with 3 hour kayak rentals or paddle board rental. Tandems and single kayaks available.  Pictures taken upon request free of charge. Instruction provided for beginners. Whether your a beginner or an expert you will love paddling here! There's a variety of marine life, nature scenery and islands to see and explore!\n\nGuided Kayaking Tours\nFun for the Whole Family Rentals\nFun for the Whole Family Rentals\n\nTake a guided kayaking tour in a saltwater bay to several uninhabited islands. There is a marine life presentation, kayaking instruction, walking tour around the islands and plenty of paddling with beautiful views of boats & coastal birds. Weaccommodate large groups and pictures are included.\n\n\n\n\nBook A Tour\nKayak Fishing\nFun for the Whole Family Rentals\nKayak Fishing\n\nWe have 9 fishing kayaks available each with 2 rod holders and a lockable hatch. We are experts on fishing. We will give you guidance where to fish & what bait to use. There's a variety of Saltwater species in our bay including Redfish, Speckled trout, Flounder, Jack Crevalle, Mackerel, Sheepshead ect.. start as early as when the sun comes up. Call to book your fishing excursion!\n\nKayak fishing\n\nCheck out this great video! The reds are biting! These stealthy fish cruise through the clear water of the bay, and are biting on little cracked crabs. Sight fishing and casting to them is king. \n\nWelcome\n\nThere's much to see here. So, take your time and look around.\n\nEstablished in 2013\n\nFind out more\nVideo\n\nManta rays swimming across the shallow sandbar around the first island. I am so grateful to get to experience all this life we have here! I think everyone should experience it at least once! There are redfish, speckled trout, dolphins, manatees, sea turtles, hermit crabs and blue crabs here to name a few of our marine life. We also have coastal birds such as the Osprey, the Great Blue Heron, Snowy white Egret, Snowy plover, Sandpipers and more… Come see what we have to offer! call today!\n\nSubscribe\nEmail\nSign up\nPhoto Gallery\nFacebookInstagramTikTokYelpYouTube\nFacebookInstagramTikTokYelpYouTube\nFacebookInstagramTikTokYelpYouTube\nFacebookInstagramTikTokYelpYouTube\nFacebookInstagramTikTokYelpYouTube\nFacebookInstagramTikTokYelpYouTube\nPhoto Gallery\nContact Us\nDrop us a line!\nName*\nEmail*\nSend\n\nThis site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply.\n\nCall for an appointment Today!\n\nWe are located in beautiful Perdido Key, Florida near the beach between Ono island and holiday harbor marina on a saltwater bay with uninhabited islands to paddle to and explore\n\nLittleheads Kayak Rentals\n\n14140 River Road, Pensacola, Florida 32507, United States\n\n251-284-5107 littleheadskayaks@yahoo.com\n\nHours\n\nWe do not have set hours-by appointment only. Call anytime for an appointment\n\nGet directions\nMenu\nWater Sports Rentals\n\nWe have a variety of kayaks to choose from and paddle boards\n\nSolo kayak rental\n$25 per hr or 3 hrs for $60\n\nWe have ocean brand kayaks some with a 325 Lb weight limit and some with a 400 Lb weight limit and a glass bottom viewing area. The rental is for up to 3 hours but you can add additional hours\n\nTandem kayak rental\n$35 per hr or 3 hrs for $80\n\nOcean brand mallibu II tandem kayak all kayaks come with back support seats. \n\nFishing kayak rental\n$30 per hr or 3 hrs for $65\n\nAll of our fishing kayaks are ocean sit on top kayaks with 2 rod holders and a lockable hatch and also extra storage space in the back. There is a place to attach your paddle to the kayak while your fighting a fish\n\nPaddle Board Rental\n$25 per hr or 3 hrs for $60\n\nWe have very stable yolo yaks for rent. The rental is for up to three hours. Get relaxed with a whole new view as you stand up and glide over the water on a paddle board. \n\nGlass bottom kayak\n$25 per hr or 3 hrs for $60\n\nwide  high weight limit kayak with a glass bottom viewing area large window to see underneath your kayak in the clear water of perdido key, Florida. you may see all sorts of fish, manta rays and even dolphins among other things. \n\nGuided kayaking tours\n\nWe offer several amazing tours\n\nUninhabited island hopping eco tour\nCall for price\n\nwith the guided kayaking eco tour there is a live marine life presentation, kayaking instruction, paddling to 3 islands, 360 degree walking tour around an island, free time to swim and explore on another island and Lots of professional looking photos and cold water included. Even pictures of everyone in their kayaks\n\nGuided kayaking Sunset tour\nCall for price\n\nTake a tour with a knowledgeable guide an expert on everything marine. He will guide you to the islands, explore marine life and enjoy viewing coastal birds and boats. Pictures with the sunset in the background while your in your kayaks are priceless!!!\n\nKayaking dolphin sighting tour\nCall for price\n\nLook for dolphins while being guided through our saltwater paradise. The dolphins are always somewhere in our waterways. As we search for them we will do a walking tour around an island and get photos of you as we get up close with nature. We often times see manatees as well. \n\nCall for a reservation today! 251-284-5107\n\nPet friendly & military discount \n\nCopyright © 2022 Littleheads Kayak Rentals - All Rights Reserved.\n\nPowered by",
          "title": "Littleheads Kayak Rentals - Guided Kayaking Tours, Kayak Fishing"
        }
      ],
